# mayhem/kat's build artifacts. The upstream root .gitignore only ignores a
# top-level `target/` (`**/target/` — see puffin's own .gitignore), which DOES
# match nested dirs, but we still keep this explicit for clarity/robustness and
# because it must exist BEFORE the first `git add mayhem/` (a bare add without it
# would risk staging build artifacts). (mayhem/fuzz/ carries its own .gitignore,
# cargo-fuzz convention.)
kat/target/
